<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n78615" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραπνέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>blow beside, escape by a sideway</i>, of the winds
			confined by Aeolus, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				10.24
			</span></i> ; <i>blow beside</i> or <i>next to</i>, c. acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ Ἀπηλιώτης ἔχει παραπνέοντας αὐτὸν
					τὸν Εὖρον καὶ τὸν Καικίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Gp.</u>
					1.11.2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>admit the air</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραπνευσάσης τῆς σικύας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hero
					<u>Spir.</u>
					1
				</span></i>
			
			<u>Prooem.</u> :— 
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς μηδαμόθι -πνεῖσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					6.577
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>have a slight smell</i> or <i>whiff of</i> a thing, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινος</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.19.3
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
